msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt1Intro"
msgid ""
"The BOSS got interested in\n"
"the research they have going here,\l"
"so he sent us out.\p"
"You quit meddling!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:77
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt1Defeat"
msgid ""
"Blast it…\n"
"Blasted by a kid…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:81
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Our BOSS knows everything.\p"
"But I'm just a GRUNT. What would I know\n"
"about what he's thinking?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:86
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt4Intro"
msgid ""
"Huh?\n"
"What's a kid doing here?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:90
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt4Defeat"
msgid ""
"Huh?\n"
"I lost?!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:94
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_Grunt4PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Oh, no…\n"
"I'll catch an earful for losing to a kid…\p"
"I should just take a nap in the bed…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:99
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_EveryoneWentUpstairs"
msgid ""
"While I was sleeping, everyone went\n"
"upstairs!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:103
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_WowYoureStrong"
msgid ""
"Wow, you're really strong!\p"
"I wish I could be a POKéMON TRAINER\n"
"like you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:108
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_ProfStudyingRain"
msgid ""
"The PROFESSOR loves rain.\n"
"That's a fact.\p"
"But if it keeps raining, people will be in\n"
"trouble. That's another fact.\p"
"And thus, the PROFESSOR is studying\n"
"if the rain can be put to good use.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_NoticingAbnormalWeather"
msgid ""
"On the 2nd floor of the INSTITUTE,\n"
"we study the weather patterns over\l"
"the HOENN region.\p"
"We've been noticing temporary and\n"
"isolated cases of droughts and\l"
"heavy rain lately…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:124
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_WhatWereAquasUpTo"
msgid ""
"Hello!\n"
"We've been saved by your actions!\p"
"What I don't understand is what on\n"
"earth the AQUAS were up to.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F/scripts.inc:130
msgctxt "Route119_WeatherInstitute_1F_Text_TakeRestInBed"
